<p><strong>EXPERIMENT LOG 03</strong></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p><strong>Experimenter:</strong> Dr. John Holden<br />
<strong>Subject:</strong> SCP-5944-1B (formerly D-2481)</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Procedure:</strong> SCP-5944-1B was placed in a vacuum sealed chamber for approximately 48<br />
minutes.</p>
<p><strong>Result:</strong> No effect.</p>
<p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> Due to lack of any discernible effect, experiments involving oxygen<br />
deprivation will cease indefinitely.</p>
